<title>ISRAEL: Israeli soldier hurt in West Bank shooting - radio.</title>
<headline>Israeli soldier hurt in West Bank shooting - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Israeli soldier guarding a Jewish settlement near the West Bank town of Hebron was wounded in an apparent drive-by shooting on Friday, Israel Radio said.</p>
<p>The radio said the soldier was &quot;moderately&quot; wounded. No further details were immediately available.</p>
